  - m_Id: 14780126544781502
    m_Localized: SIGNAL WAVEFORM CHECK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781503
    m_Localized: Guide the agent to the target coordinate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781504
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781505
    m_Localized: SIGNAL WAVEFORM CHECK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781506
    m_Localized: '<b>Select a Coordinate</b>

      Use the left and right buttons
      to choose the next coordinate.


      <b>Guide the Agent</b>

      When the
      two radar markers overlap, the agent is facing the target.

      Report the
      angle and remaining distance to guide the agent to the target coordinate.


      <b>Next
      Step</b>

      The agent must install the antenna before the dial operator
      can tune the frequency.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
