      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781541
    m_Localized: 'Listen to the complete sound.

      The Morse table is located
      at HQ.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781542
    m_Localized: CONFIRM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781543
    m_Localized: OBSERVATION MONITOR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781544
    m_Localized: Values are hidden. Give directions from the indicators.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781545
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781546
    m_Localized: OBSERVATION MONITOR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781547
    m_Localized: "<b>Read the Display</b>\n Green  correct now\n Yellow  increase\n
      Orange  decrease\n\n<b>Give Directions</b>\nSay exactly what you see.\n\"Raise
      temperature\" / \"Lower concentration\" / \"Stop\"\n\n<b>Goal</b>\nKeep both
      readings stable for 4 seconds. Values continue to fluctuate, so keep giving
      directions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781548
    m_Localized: TEMPERATURE CONTROL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781549
    m_Localized: The target range is hidden. Follow the directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781550
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781551
    m_Localized: TEMPERATURE CONTROL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781552
    m_Localized: "<b>Operation</b>\n changes the temperature by 2 degrees per press.\n\n<b>Follow
      Directions</b>\n \"Raise temperature\"  \n \"Lower temperature\"  \n \"Stop\" 
      do not press\nPress once, then wait for the response.\n\n<b>Caution</b>\nThe
      temperature continues to fluctuate after reaching the target, so keep watching
      the display."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781553
    m_Localized: CONCENTRATION CONTROL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781554
    m_Localized: The target range is hidden. Follow the directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781555
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781556
    m_Localized: CONCENTRATION CONTROL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781557
    m_Localized: "<b>Operation</b>\n changes the concentration by 2 per press.\n\n<b>Follow
      Directions</b>\n \"Raise concentration\"  \n \"Lower concentration\"  \n \"Stop\" 
      do not press\nOnly respond to directions that mention <b>\"concentration.\"</b>\n\n<b>Caution</b>\nThe
      concentration continues to fluctuate after reaching the target, so keep watching
      the display."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781558
