  - m_Id: 19022537612771336
    m_Localized: Objective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771337
    m_Localized: "Movement \xB7 Interaction \xB7 Gear"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771338
    m_Localized: HQ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771339
    m_Localized: Finding Clues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771340
    m_Localized: Mission Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771341
    m_Localized: Clues & Montage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771342
    m_Localized: Tracking & Capture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771343
    m_Localized: '<b>Find the alien hiding in the crowd and capture it.</b>

      An
      alien has slipped into the crowd.

      Work with the other agents to catch
      it.


      Gather clues before time runs out

      and use them to identify
      the suspect.


      Each capture advances you to the next round.

      The
      operation runs for three rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771344
    m_Localized: "<b>Movement & Camera</b>\\nWASD  Move   \xB7   Mouse  Look\\nShift 
      Sprint   \xB7   Space  Jump\\n\\n<b>Interaction & Gear</b>\\nE  Inspect / Interact\\n1-4
      / Wheel  Select slot   \xB7   G  Drop\\n\\n<b>Extra Screens</b>\\nTab  Montage  
      \xB7   Esc  Settings"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771345
    m_Localized: '<b>Where HQ Is</b>

      HQ sits on the map. From there you can
      check the CCTV feeds, the map and the collected clues, then share them with
      the field team.


      A door inside HQ leads down to the alien lair and more
      clues.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771346
    m_Localized: '<b>Search the Basement for Clues</b>

      Take the HQ door down
      to the basement where the alien roams and collect the clues there. (one trait
      each)


      The alien tracks agents by voice and footsteps, and drains their
      health.


      An agent who runs out of health needs a teammate to revive
      them,

      so search out of the alien''s sight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771347
    m_Localized: '<b>Restore the CCTV Signal</b>

      Match the wire colors to
      bring HQ''s CCTV back online.


      <b>Battery Breaker (co-op)</b>

      Collect
      batteries in the field and slot them into the breaker panel to reach the target
      power and restore the city''s power.


      Full instructions are on the manual
      at the bottom left of each device panel.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537612771348
    m_Localized: '<b>1. Clues are shared with the team</b>

      Once collected,
      a clue is visible to every agent.


      <b>2. Build the montage at the HQ
      console</b>

      On the console''s Montage tab, combine traits into a portrait
      and send it to all agents.


      <b>3. Press Tab to review</b>

      Any
      agent can press Tab to see the clues and the montage.


      TIP. Building
      a montage is optional.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19022537616965632
    m_Localized: "<b>1. Search for the hidden alien</b>\r\nUse your clues to find
      and interact with a suspect.\r\nA wrong guess costs you 2 minutes.\r\n\r\n<b>2.
      The alien flees \u2014 get the capture tool</b>\r\nOnce exposed, the alien
      runs. Pick up the \"Alien Suppressor\" at HQ.\r\n\r\n<b>3. Subdue it together</b>\r\nTwo
      agents must hold the left mouse button near the target.\r\nFill the gauge to
      finish the capture and start the next round."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
